  - Community Influence Index (CII): CII = \sqrt{\text{Follower Count} \times \text{Content Reach}}

  - Social Butterfly: A fan is a Social Butterfly if their Social Capital Score (SCS) is greater than 1000 and they are a member of more than 5 community groups.'
